@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed LC-04 Applications owned model and external artifact reference
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #164E63
top to bottom direction
class ApplicationRecord {
 -applicationId : ApplicationId
 -ownerId : ActorId
 -version : RevisionId
}
class PreparationRevision
class ProgressEvent
class SubmissionEvent {
 +eventId : SubmissionId
 +actualProvenance : EventProvenance
}
class SubmissionMaterialSet {
 +setId : MaterialSetId
 +completeness : ObservedCompleteness
}
class MaterialReference {
 +artifactId : ArtifactId
 +roleAndSource : MaterialProvenance
}
class SubmissionCorrection
class "Files-owned Artifact" as Artifact <<external owner>>
ApplicationRecord "1" -- "0..*" PreparationRevision
ApplicationRecord "1" -- "0..*" ProgressEvent
ApplicationRecord "1" -- "0..*" SubmissionEvent
SubmissionEvent "1" -- "1" SubmissionMaterialSet : proposed event/set identity
SubmissionMaterialSet "1" -- "0..*" MaterialReference : incomplete set possible
SubmissionEvent "1" -- "0..*" SubmissionCorrection
MaterialReference ..> Artifact : protected stable reference
note bottom of MaterialReference
 Actual history is not a mutable live-resume pointer.
 Multiplicities are design proposals, not source approval.
 Physical schema and reference handshake remain to refine.
end note
@enduml
